{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-13","kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正四面体","englishTitle":"To construct a pyramid, to comprehend it in a given sphere, and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is one and a half times the square on the side of the pyramid.","book":13,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","contentId":"euclid-13-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d2e4685a37b030aa045e672178b0babe0f0b94317bd855cfff953ff6157fa54","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-13.statement","euclid-13-13.construction.1","euclid-13-13.proof.1","euclid-13-13.proof.2","euclid-13-13.proof.3","euclid-13-13.proof.4","euclid-13-13.proof.5","euclid-13-13.proof.6","euclid-13-13.proof.7","euclid-13-13.proof.8","euclid-13-13.proof.9","euclid-13-13.proof.10","euclid-13-13.proof.11","euclid-13-13.construction.2","euclid-13-13.proof.12","euclid-13-13.proof.13","euclid-13-13.proof.14","euclid-13-13.proof.15","euclid-13-13.proof.16","euclid-13-13.proof.17","euclid-13-13.proof.18","euclid-13-13.proof.19","euclid-13-13.proof.20","euclid-13-13.proof.21","euclid-13-13.proof.22","euclid-13-13.construction.3","euclid-13-13.proof.23","euclid-13-13.proof.24","euclid-13-13.proof.25","euclid-13-13.conclusion","euclid-13-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"531fcab108004f435ae07924e2be9f3c608ef42cdafe9aa35394ec3c9307425c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct a pyramid, to comprehend it in a given sphere, and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is one and a half times the square on the side of the pyramid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"建造金字塔,在某个球体中理解它, 并证明球的直径是金字塔边的正方形的1.5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8423378c2d7207edc842ea590b2b9aeec8b49190db859cf4c302f65748434346","citations":["euclid-4-2","euclid-3-1","euclid-11-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the diameter AB of the given sphere be set out, and let it be cut at the point C so that AC is double of CB; let the semicircle ADB be described on AB, let CD be drawn from the point C at right angles to AB, and let DA be joined; let the circle EFG which has its radius equal to DC be set out, let the equilateral triangle EFG be inscribed in the circle EFG, [[IV. 2](/principles/euclid-4-2)] let the centre of the circle, the point H, be taken, [[III. 1](/principles/euclid-3-1)] let EH, HF, HG be joined; from the point H let HK be set up at right angles to the plane of the circle EFG, [[XI. 12](/principles/euclid-11-12)] let HK equal to the straight line AC be cut off from HK, and let KE, KF, KG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将特定球体的直径AB确定下来,在C点将其切除,使AC点为CB的两倍;在AB点描述ADB半圆圈,从直角点至AB点划出CD,并连接DA;在EFG点标出其半径等于DC的圆圈,将等边三角形、EFG点标入EFG,将圆的中心,即H点标入EH,HF,HG点标入;从HHKC到EFG平面,将HKAC线从HK线切断,KEKFKG连接。 [[IV. 2](/principles/euclid-4-2)] [[III. 1](/principles/euclid-3-1)] [[XI. 12](/principles/euclid-11-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a8d0c7417506b2879fe227ce5fc257c1d97fcf666ec8dd0b88e0e4b42cd2bf1","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since KH is at right angles to the plane of the circle EFG, therefore it will also make right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane of the circle EFG. [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,KH是EFG圈的直角到平面,所以它也会达到直角, 加上所有横贯的直线, 并且位于EFG圈的平面。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0282f61516bcd45bb34f7f9ab9c7afed2bfb64008367c2706b8c03ec9a095b01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But each of the straight lines HE, HF, HG meets it: therefore HK is at right angles to each of the straight lines HE, HF, HG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但HE,HF,HG直线的每一个线相交:因此,HK直线的每一个线在直角,HF,HG直线的每一个线之间相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8c604d41309efca02316b18b394f0c56137ddaf747ec1fad0f75da7609c54a1","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AC is equal to HK, and CD to HE, and they contain right angles, therefore the base DA is equal to the base KE. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC等于HK,CD至HE, 含有直角, 所以底边 DA等于底边 KE。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48a09f969dccb0f1bf87954c1e1fb4ee994098346ebf93484b44a8ce9e8bd625","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the straight lines KF, KG is also equal to DA; therefore the three straight lines KE, KF, KG are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,KF、KG直线各等于DA;因此,3条直线KE、KF、KG等等同一条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c70ce5481cbd026b21199635b42e6d5b21d87d5c7516198f8e57b189a52fefc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AC is double of CB, therefore AB is triple of BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC是CB的两倍 所以AB是BC的三倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed49bac87f7850eb2f5f84b17a2ff848f7c7be43af7992a10be85423fe98f3ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AB is to BC, so is the square on AD to the square on DC, as will be proved afterwards."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB比BC的比等于AD比正方形,DC比正方形,这将在随后得到证明"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"233aed334a4dd250ed921b80b24a9c22291b982eee94d813970b563c192ba2dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on AD is triple of the square on DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AD的正方形是DC正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5285a50a34d2f6443b754910f155b8717753cda1142d20eb049da105d38cd760","citations":["euclid-13-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on FE is also triple of the square on EH, [[XIII. 12](/principles/euclid-13-12)] and DC is equal to EH; therefore DA is also equal to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FE比正方形比EH比正方形,DC等于EH,DA也等于EF。 [[XIII. 12](/principles/euclid-13-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2273e05de1dc96e62d5f7708148f42b5de6f5ac0c6abdd3dc75076e5a32b4cb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DA was proved equal to each of the straight lines KE, KF, KG; therefore each of the straight lines EF, FG, GE is also equal to each of the straight lines KE, KF, KG; therefore the four triangles EFG, KEF, KFG, KEG are equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DA线被证明等于KE直线、KF直线、KG直线和EF直线、FG直线和GE直线,KE直线和KF直线和KG直线,因此,4个三角形是等式的,EFG直线和KEF直线和KFG直线。（相关点与线段：KEG）"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"485d5e10bb31d9f78fccbf5ee609f0781d0299de19bc08dc1386514c72984080","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore a pyramid has been constructed out of four equilateral triangles, the triangle EFG being its base and the point K its vertex."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在4 等边三角形个金字塔中建起了一座金字塔,三角形EFG是它的底边个,点K是它的顶部。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"036f5379311a2044f4dc15d8681cb54e75c17360cee37527d1933b3b8fd125df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next required to comprehend it in the given sphere and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is one and a half times the square on the side of the pyramid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步需要将它理解为特定球体,并证明球体直径的正方形是金字塔边正方形的1.5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":13,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f4470e708adb8d80ca6a7b9c0098aad6a7c4599a9ee1043ede22801f3cbfad0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line HL be produced in a straight line with KH, and let HL be made equal to CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将直线 HL延伸为KH直线,将直线 HL改为CB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"590f8271493878c1ae1d833cb73180edcb7eaa97bf0273665a163eb53e3a44d4","citations":["euclid-6-8","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since, as AC is to CD, so is CD to CB, [[VI. 8, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-8)] while AC is equal to KH, CD to HE, and CB to HL, therefore, as KH is to HE, so is EH to HL; therefore the rectangle KH, HL is equal to the square on EH. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AC对CD的比等于CD对CB,AC等于KH,CD对HE,CB对HL,KH对HE,EH对HL,矩形对KH,HL等于EH对正方形；AC 与 CD 之比等于 CD 与 CB 之比；KH 与 HE 之比等于 EH 与 HL 之比。 [[VI. 8, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-8)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1454a24df418383d48098a7d9e39f9708e948f27db81640ffb71eeaa655a2b39","citations":["euclid-6-8","euclid-3-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And each of the angles KHE. EHL is right; therefore the semicircle described on KL will pass through E also. [cf. [VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8), [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31).]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每一个角度都是KHE,EHL是正确的。 因此,KL上描述的半圆圈也会通过E。 ] [cf. [VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8) [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d793c59190d087d36370403fc6e1281907707122072ab413ad103938f18fb32","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then, KL remaining fixed, the semicircle be carried round and restored to the same position from which it began to be moved, it will also pass through the points F, G, since, if FL, LG be joined, the angles at F, G similarly become right angles; and the pyramid will be comprehended in the given sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果届时KL剩余圆圈仍被固定,半圆圈将圆转,并恢复到开始移动的同一位置,那么它也将穿过F、G点,因为如果连接FL、LG点,F、G点的角同样会变成直角;金字塔将被覆盖在特定领域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"927e2181f7d526b31c293e92297fa39a37578791d7b1c957718b97b1e548e2d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For KL, the diameter of the sphere, is equal to the diameter AB of the given sphere, inasmuch as KH was made equal to AC, and HL to CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"KL球的直径等于给定球的直径AB,KH等于AC,HL等于CB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0188b6b990d56655d27161ffb828153b09a5bcbfc8f0d99c6827d6c8ce357bd3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that the square on the diameter of the sphere is one and a half times the square on the side of the pyramid"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,球的直径正方形 是金字塔边正方形的1.5倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc56702e1f215d3e82d6d234a37f6ffdb2e802d343b30de68916186a6fb17968","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AC is double of CB, therefore AB is triple of BC; and, convertendo, BA is one and a half times AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AC是CB的两倍,AB是BC的三倍;而转换后,BA是AC的1.5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7d4de6930e9925066efb92dc7a4d32f5dbc6cf02ed536d7f3899842545182e22","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as BA is to AC, so is the square on BA to the square on AD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,BA比AC的比等于BA比正方形比AD"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f8c60543412c957c0d38cbc3d8f94ffe97f27c60a0eba952b45e288c4418f1f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on BA is also one and a half times the square on AD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BA正方形也是正方形AD的1.5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2d45582a28cff90006c115efbf6f75fb4f6b58e90c4c6c11496df7b05b971f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And BA is the diameter of the given sphere, and AD is equal to the side of the pyramid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA是给定球的直径, AD等于金字塔的侧面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d09c3515eaf0e0c074b8647fd6ca3abf0cac00d674742317f41c4497b53be5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on the diameter of the sphere is one and a half times the square on the side of the pyramid. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,球体直径的正方形是金字塔边正方形的1.5倍。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"240fc5549b251d004008af0fff651c27184b4bfc39be9e9cf6a90f89031b15eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. It is to be proved that, as AB is to BC, so is the square on AD to the square on DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"莱姆马:AB比BC等于AD比正方形比DC"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":25,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4bb84d90f65487ff819663a60525df33bc8c25a6db2778276d7d89d1061833f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the figure of the semicircle be set out, let DB be joined, let the square EC be described on AC, and let the parallelogram FB be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果要列出半圆形图,请将DB连接起来,将正方形 EC图解放在AC,完成平行四边形 FB图解。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1147c856cc3297fc6aa1c16b50c3200d0bbb2035cdcd2b71bd4b76032f1fcf0","citations":["euclid-6-8","euclid-6-4","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, because the triangle DAB is equiangular with the triangle DAC, as BA is to AD, so is DA to AC, [[VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8), [VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] therefore the rectangle BA, AC is equal to the square on AD. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,由于三角形DAB是三角形DAC的等角,BA比AD等于DA比AC,]因此,矩形、BA比AC等于AD比正方形；BA 与 AD 之比等于 DA 与 AC 之比。 [ [VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8) [VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4) [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c405e568f7b1ed7ea2fa5dc032f9c862c5d1ac561b1913703058212b6afd5b04","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as AB is to BC, so is EB to BF, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] and EB is the rectangle BA, AC, for EA is equal to AC, and BF is the rectangle AC, CB, therefore, as AB is to BC, so is the rectangle BA, AC to the rectangle AC, CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB比BC等于EB比BF,EB等于矩形、BA,AC,EA等于AC,BF等于矩形、AC,CB,AB等于BC,矩形,BA比矩形、AC,CB,CB,矩形比BC,矩形,BA比矩形；AB 与 BC 之比等于 EB 与 BF 之比 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ed8783662c218e55b6b640a0c1fe0a0a04fe25dc221313bb962d5269e6e365c","citations":["euclid-6-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the rectangle BA, AC is equal to the square on AD, and the rectangle AC, CB to the square on DC, for the perpendicular DC is a mean proportional between the segments AC, CB of the base, because the angle ADB is right. [[VI. 8, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形 BA AC等于AD的正方形,矩形 AC至正方形,DC,因为直径DC是底边段AC、CB之间的比例中项,因为角度ADB是正确的。 [[VI. 8, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":29,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"494fab543e5fd5b090023fa2a3590c28187bae717c19301910b1f63fdf9d3d40","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as AB is to BC, so is the square on AD to the square on DC. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB比BC等于AD比正方形比DC比正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-13.source","contentId":"euclid-13-13","revisionId":"euclid-13-13@raw-5d2e4685a37b030a","order":30,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f80ef61666e3ba8b59b97fc2f79baa04b26f0462d75a67cda83ce2728b5ff84","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath s